  "english_paragraphs": [
    "The first time my puppy saw my friend's kitten, it was very scared.",
    "The second time the puppy saw the kitten, it stood beside the kitten and watched it.",
    "The third time it saw the kitten, it went over and played with it.",
    "Soon, they became good friends."
  ],
  "english_full": "The first time my puppy saw my friend's kitten, it was very scared.\n\nThe second time the puppy saw the kitten, it stood beside the kitten and watched it.\n\nThe third time it saw the kitten, it went over and played with it.\n\nSoon, they became good friends.",
  "russian_paragraphs": [
    "Пе́рвый раз мой кутёнок у́видел котёнка моего друга, он был очень испу́ганный.",
    "Второ́й раз кутёнок уви́дел котёнка, он стал рядом с котёнком и смотрел на него.",
    "Тре́тий раз он уви́дел котёнка, он подошёл и играл с ним.",
    "Ско́ро они ста́ли хоро́шими друзья́ми."
  ],
  "reading_paragraphs": [
    "Pérvyy raz moy kutyónok úvidel kotyónka moyego drúga, on byl óchen' ispúgannyy.",
    "Vtoróy raz kutyónok uvidél kotyónka, on stal ryádom s kotyónkom i smotrel na nego.",
    "Tretíy raz on uvidél kotyónka, on podoshyól i igral s nim.",
    "Skórо oni stáli khoróshimi druz'yámi."
  ],
